+# Process audit — S5-CLM-00003506
+
+The worker claim is `S5THM-00003506-TARGET--worker` and owns only
+`S5THM-00003506-TARGET`. The frozen record, source locator, Stage6 alias, and baseline
+digests are copied into `intake.json`.
+
+- INTAKE: exact record, source bytes, conditionality, rights, and migration evidence bound.
+- STATEMENT: source notation, `FrozenStatement`, `Target`, and transports compile.
+- ANCHOR: pinned source/paper references and local content digests recorded.
+- TREE: typed acyclic proof-unit graph with one readable anchor per node.
+- MACHINE: trust-zero diagnostics compile; analytic refutation root remains open.
+- READABLE: every frontier node has one injective delimited fragment.
+- VALIDATE: cold replay, forbidden-token, JSON/seal, mutation, and claim checks pass.
+- RELEASE: provisional nonacceptance awaits canonical Master review.
+
+The provider body is not imported. No canonical checkout, Blueprint, catalog, second
+mathematical ID, collaboration tool, or claim-specific axiom was used.
